        "markdown": "[Home](/) · [Services](/services) · [Solar](/solar) · [Contact](/contact)\n\n# Volt Caribbean Electric\n\nLicensed electricians for villas, shops and boats in Saint-Barthélemy.\n\n## Services\n\n- New installations and rewiring\n- Electrical compliance certificates (Consuel)\n- Fault finding and repairs\n- Solar panels, batteries and inverters\n- Generators and automatic transfer switches\n- EV charger installation\n- Marine electrical work at the dock\n\n## Rates\n\nHourly rate €75 excluding VAT. Diagnostic visit €90. Free quotes for solar and generator projects.\n\n## Hours\n\nMonday to Friday, 7:30am to 4:30pm. Emergency service on weekends for existing clients.\n\nFounded in 2014 by Marco Silva, master electrician. Team of six, all French-certified.\n\nWinner of the island's \"Green Business\" award in 2023 for our solar installations.\n\nVolt Caribbean Electric, Rue de la Colline, Gustavia 97133\n+590 590 00 40 12 · WhatsApp +590 690 00 40 12 · jobs@voltcaribbean.example\n\nEnglish, French and Portuguese spoken.\n\n© Volt Caribbean Electric · Privacy"
      }
